An opener under a quote in a nested host opens at one column only

````
- a
  > q
  ```js
  c
  ```
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
    <pre><code class="language-js">c
</code></pre>
  </li>
</ul>
````

